NewStatus.rexx. What is it?
---------------------------

Okay first of all its a simple status viewer for your users to see their
current status on your BBS. Nothing simpler eh!

I havent seen a program for Cnet that will do as this one does. Maybe I'm
wrong, I dont know. Anyway, this new status program will also allow you to
view ANOTHER users status as well. You can also give users with the right
access the ability to do this too.

To allow other users to view someone elses status all you need to do is
alter the variable in the code itself. The variable name is 'allowed'. Its
commented in the code so you'll easily find it.

Thats about it! Add to your sys.welcome as an arexx file. Add to your
bbsmenu for all to use if they wish. You do know how to do this ;-/

Try it. You may like it!

